{"catch":"尋找內心的平靜，探索自然的野性之美。","desc":"在寧靜又引人入勝的文字搜尋冒險遊戲 Word Quest: Nature 中，重新與大自然連結。漫步於鬱鬱蔥蔥的森林、靜謐的湖泊、繁花盛開的草原與雄偉壯麗的山脈，連接字母，找出以戶外自然之美為靈感的隱藏詞彙。每一道謎題都邀請你放鬆身心、深呼吸，並展開探索。你的旅程能在大自然的奇景中走多遠呢？","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-08-27","genres":["益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/404a6c09a4addecd0de1e7541348ad8182f0b8e3ad35af48e87e064612cb5ccc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53f7110e09d8690901d9d652b95d4577c1d3d3ace0cc9e356099706f1afbafdb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1fd0398c9be545b50a1a983813e869ccd7ebed6c64aa98c0097a1c71a13c1f4d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1640f47bc275d425bb4adec44065d9ea8e610597a4459f2de59928c62205c0c8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fec60917cc289182776deff4b47d7a623ec146bd5c874e994d7624da9386f34b.jpg"]}